'' THE UCRT's INLINE stdio FUNCTIONS LINK on windows-x86_64: printf, vprintf, vfprintf,
'' vsnprintf, scanf, fscanf and sscanf were each "undefined symbol" there. The runtime is
'' the one THIS TREE built (lib/rt/lib/windows-x86_64), ahead of the packaged toolchain's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i toolchains/tiko-windows/inc -p lib/rt/lib/windows-x86_64 tests/driver/src/stdio-family.bas -o tests/driver/stdiofamily.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/driver/stdiofamily.exe
